# Manifest categories (setup/packages.yaml) the xps work laptop is expected
# to have installed — read by pkg-missing, pkg-tui [missing] and
# `mise run pkg-install` (no args).
#
# One category per line; `!pkgname` excludes a single package; # comments.

bootstrap-mirrors
bootstrap-aur-helper
languages
cli-essentials
fish-shell
helix-editor
niri-wm
yazi
fastfetch
docs-toolchain
containers
emacs
file-transfer
input-method
printing
keyboard-firmware
security
